    "answer": {
      "short": "\\$18 972.97 total tax payable.",
      "worked": "Taxable income:\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Taxable income}&=84\\,000-(900+474)\\\\\\text{Taxable income}&=\\$82\\,626\\end{align*}$$\nThis is in the \\$45 001–\\$120 000 bracket.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Excess}&=82\\,626-45\\,000\\\\\\text{Excess}&=\\$37\\,626\\\\\\text{Income tax}&=5092+0.325\\times37\\,626\\\\\\text{Income tax}&=\\$17\\,320.45\\\\\\text{Medicare levy}&=0.02\\times82\\,626\\\\\\text{Medicare levy}&=\\$1652.52\\\\\\text{Total tax payable}&=17\\,320.45+1652.52\\\\\\text{Total tax payable}&=\\$18\\,972.97\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
